# GoboRefined: every third-party file the build downloads, pinned by version and sha256.
# build/build.sh reads this file; a download whose sha256 differs is refused.
#
# Fields (one line per file, separated by spaces; # starts a comment):
#   step  version  file  sha256  licence  url
# "step" is the spin/build-programs.sh step that uses the file ("iso" = the stock ISO the
# image is made from). Licences as stated by the upstream sources (SPDX names); see
# docs/third-party.md for details and for what the stock ISO itself contains.
#
# Where the sha256 comes from: values recorded when the file was first downloaded for the
# lab build (HANDOFF.md) or taken from the copy kept in the lab's build VM (/Data/Build) on
# 2026-11-15; the stock ISO's value is the one published on gobolinux.org/downloads.html;
# the RTL8852AU archive was downloaded fresh (its files are identical to the git checkout of
# that commit used before). In the from-scratch build of 2026-11-15 (GoboRefined 0.8.3) every
# file below was downloaded from its URL and matched. 0.8.4 added linux-firmware and sof-firmware
# (downloaded 2026-11-16 from the URLs below; linux-firmware matches kernel.org's sha256sums.asc).

